        "@value": "EvaluationResultType describes the outcome of an evaluation or verification process with."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasPrerequisite",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The `from` Element has a prerequisite on each `to` Element, during a LifecycleScopeType period."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "hasPrerequisite"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/evidenceUUID",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The UUID used by a reporting management system or any other lifecycle management tool to uniquely identify an evidence relationship item. UUID, or universally unique ID, is a standard term to refer to evidence items."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "evidenceUUID"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/cwe",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "[Common Weakness Enumeration](https://csrc.nist.gov/glossary/term/common_weakness_enumeration). A reference to a source of software flaw defined within the official [CWE List](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/) that conforms to the [CWE specification](https://cwe.mitre.org/)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "cwe"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
